; XAUUSD_M1_LiquidityZeroCross_Bearish v1.10 - M2 trigger / H1 bias / 12:00-16:30 server time
; Chosen with 2025 data ONLY (median of the setup and its neighbouring settings, >=30 trades per half-year); 2026 was not used, so the 2026 figure is out of sample.
; Backtest: 186 trades, PF 1.55, net +19.9R, max DD 4.9R; PF 1.51 / 1.56 (2025, in-sample) / 1.61 on 43 trades (2026, out of sample).
; Depends on trailing: if every same-bar trailing touch counts as a stop, PF is 1.05. With the FlashGold filter PF falls to 1.44 (73 trades): not recommended here.
; When no liquidity pool pays MinRewardRisk, TP is a fixed 1.5R (TP_FallbackRR=1.5).
; Session hours are BROKER SERVER TIME (TradingHoursAreGMT=false). They were calibrated on FTMO data whose clock is GMT+2 winter / GMT+3 summer (New York close).
; UseNewsFilter=true was NOT part of the backtest (no calendar history); live trade count and results will differ. Set it to false to match the backtest exactly.
; Points are 2-digit gold units scaled by sqrt(2) for M2 (AutoScalePoints handles 3-digit feeds). Signals use M2 on any chart.
